{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17322453","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17322453","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1732245301:0":{"text":"말도 안 돼요! 그냥 그런 게 있다는 얘기를 들어본 것뿐이에요!","source_cn":"怎么可能！我只是记得在哪里听过类似效果魔法药剂的消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB384E7A14D7F3C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732245302:0":{"text":"전 불면증을 치료하는 좋은 꿈 포션이나 피부를 좋아지게 하는 촉촉 마법 파우더, 발모용 생강 포션 밖에 없어요...","source_cn":"我这摊位上只有治疗失眠的好梦魔药，还有让皮肤变好的水润...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47EBE1FB9DD2DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732245303:0":{"text":"별로 쓸모가 없는 포션 같은데...","source_cn":"听起来都是些没什么实质用处的魔法药剂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F29E5456FC64EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732245304:0":{"text":"전부 별로 큰 고민 같은 건 없는 귀족 나리들에게 파는 거예요.","source_cn":"这些魔法药剂都是卖给贵族老爷们的，他们也没有实质性的烦恼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09BBBF8C891A2DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摊主斯丹佛":{"text":"노점 주인 스탠퍼드","source":"摊主斯丹佛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军赛门":{"text":"근위대원 시몬","source":"守备军赛门","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}